==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|salutacion}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|salutatio||a greeting, a wishing health to}}, from {{m|la|saluto||wish one’s health, greet}}, from {{m|la|salus||well-being}}. Compare the {{etyl|la|en}} greeting ''[[salvere|salve]]'' (“be well”).

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia}}

# A [[greeting]], [[salute]], or [[address]]; a [[hello]].
# The act of greeting.
# The title in your name, such as Mr, Mrs, Ms., Dr. or Rev..

